UPDATE control_registry SET evidence = evidence || ' | PATHS-UNTESTED-1 (CONTROL-ALT-PROBES-3 2026-10-19): ALTERNATE-NOT-EXERCISABLE: the guard is a rule in code (aiFallbackFor against the AI_RATE_FALLBACK and __AI_ATTR_RATES constants of qnfo-research-exec) and its alternate, to wait one gauge window and try once more, leaves a cloud_ops_events row (kind ai-warn, text no fallback at or under its price) only when a call is rate limited. Read 2026-10-19 (SELECT only): 0 such events ever, 0 ai-skip events ever, and the only fallback events are 17 kimi-k2.6 timeouts that took the cheaper glm-5.3-flash, so a probe could only pass by absence. The rule is pinned offline by qnfo-research-exec/width-governor.test.mjs (a table entry naming a dearer model is refused at run time). alternate_tested_at stays NULL on purpose, and a control_alternate_probes row takes precedence over this reason.'
